    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shape-shift as if you had used Wild Shape, without expending a use of it, and you have the &amp;Reference[invisible apply=false]{Invisible} condition until the spell ends. The spell ends early right after you make an attack roll, deal damage, cast a spell, or return to your normal form.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bdA8K4SrPuv19JaE\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Take the Wild Shape form with your Wild Shape feature; the effect gives the Invisible condition.</p></section>",
